{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"3c21044a67613c38d8a30eaef3d117bd04be1afc021705fa69f62953becedb9c","digest":{"component_or_area":"eval-spec validation and CI gating","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/*.eval.yaml","validate_eval_spec()","tests/unit/test_eval_scorers.py",".github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml",".github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml","gerrit-verify.yaml","gold_set","dataset"],"problem_keywords":["eval-spec validation","unit test coverage","strict validation discipline","gating criterion","CI workflow"],"propositions":["Strict eval-spec validation currently runs only in a non-gating Prompt Eval workflow step, not in the default pytest suite that gates Verified votes.","Three packaged plan-review specs shipped with dataset but no gold_set and merged green (Verified +1) because strict validation did not block pre-merge.","A new unit test must glob all packaged eval specs and assert validate_eval_spec(spec) passes, plus validate_eval_spec(spec, strict=True) for dataset-bearing specs.","The redundant inline validation step in prompt-eval.yml must be removed after the unit test is added to the default suite.","The new test must fail if any dataset-bearing packaged spec lacks a gold_set, blocking Verified votes pre-merge."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787469779366619001,"uuid":"92fef2ee-4397-4694-8e13-a75a6f269ca4"}